    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305588</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_000&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ベッドを
貸してください！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lend us
your bed!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305656</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ミラルド……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mirald...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305740</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>レスター博士の
知り合い……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You know her,
Prof. Lester...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305828</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、彼女は
うちの助手のミラルドだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. She's my
assistant, Mirald.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305912</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく早く、
彼女をベッドに！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway, quick!
Get her to a bed!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305980</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どこで彼女を？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Where'd you find...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306068</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;熱砂の洞窟&lt;White&gt;で
お会いしたんです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We met her in the
&lt;Red&gt;Cavern of Burning Sands&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306156</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>たぶん、魔物に
やられたんだと思うぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm guessing monsters
did that to her.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306292</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>君たち、
本当に&lt;Red&gt;熱砂の洞窟&lt;White&gt;に……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You really went
to the &lt;Red&gt;Cavern
of Burning Sands&lt;White&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306292</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だが、
ミラルドがどうして？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, why was
Mirald there?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>さあ……精霊と契約しようと
してたみたいだけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dunno... Seemed like she
was trying to make a
pact with the spirit, though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もしかして、ミラルドさん、
&lt;Klarth&gt;さんにもう一度、
研究をがんばってもらいたくて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She might have been hoping
you would go back to
your research again...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306796</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>バカな奴だ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She's such
a fool...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306868</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんな言い方……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How could
you say that...!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307060</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>彼女の才なら
アルヴァニスタの
高等研究員になれる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>With her talent, she
could become a top
researcher in Alvanista.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307060</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>彼女は私のような異端分子の
ところで、その生涯を
履き潰すべきではないんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She shouldn't be
wasting her life beside
some dissident like me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307188</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>すっかり私に愛想を尽かして
研究所にでも行ってしまったと
思っていたのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'd thought I'd burned through the
last of our friendship, and she'd gone
off to work at some lab, or whatever...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307280</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何を吹き込まれたか
知らないけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't know what
silly ideas you've gotten 
into your head, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307348</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ミラルド……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mirald...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アルヴァニスタの研究員に
なるのが私の幸せだなんて、
あなたは本気で思っているの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do you genuinely believe
I'd be happy working as
a researcher in Alvanista?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうして……私の気持ちを
聞いてくれないの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why...do you never
listen to how I feel?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307828</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……私は父と同じ過ちを
おかしたくなかっただけだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I just don't want
to repeat my
father's mistakes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>草花を探して家に帰らず、
帰ってくれば、研究室に何日も
閉じこもりきり</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Out searching for plants for days and never
returning home. Then when he did return,
he'd shut himself in his lab for days on end.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_028&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>研究に没頭し、家族を顧みない父を
私は憎んでさえいたのかもしれない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I may have even hated him. That father
of mine who buried himself in his research,
without any concern at all for his family.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_029&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何よりも母は幸せだっただろうか？
ずっとそれが頭から離れなかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The one thing always in my mind,
more than anything else, was, "Is
my mother really happy like this...?"</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……私もおまえに母と同じことを
強いているのではと思った</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I thought I was forcing you
to live go through the same
thing my mother did, back then.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308364</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_031&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>私があなたのために
ここにいるなんて、
自惚れないで</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please, don't be so
conceited. I'm not here
for your sake, you know?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308536</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_033&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Klarth&gt;。
私は好きでここにいるのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Klarth&gt;. I'm here
because I
*want* to be.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308600</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_034&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ミラルド……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mirald...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_036&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もしかしたら、私にも、
別の形の幸せもあるでしょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There are likely other
things that could make
me happy, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_037&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、今が幸せなのに、
他のものを求める必要がある？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, if I'm happy where I am
now, as I am now, why would
I need to pursue anything else?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_038&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>きっと……あなたのお母様も
私と同じ気持ちだったと、思う</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sure...your mother felt the
same way. Or I think so, at least.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_040&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……すまない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Sorry...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_041&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いや、ありがとう。
ミラルド</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No. Thank
you, Mirald.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309244</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_042&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Klarth&gt;……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Klarth&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309308</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_043&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>U-Um...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309488</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_044&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、す、すまない……
君たちも。悪かった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, s-sorry... To you
kids, too. I was wrong.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309488</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_045&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それで？　精霊の力を
集めるために私に力を
借してほしいというのは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, you said you
wanted my help
gathering the spirits...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309568</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_046&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔術の暴走を止めるのよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You needed to stop some
out-of-control magic, didn't you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309656</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_047&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はい。その、
『虹輪』を消すために</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes. We need to do
something about a,
um... "Prism Ring."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309744</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_048&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>その契約の指輪っての
貸してくれよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lend us those
pact ring things.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309820</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_049&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっと、&lt;Dio&gt;……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, &lt;Dio&gt;...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309952</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_050&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……すまないが、契約の指輪は
とても貴重なものでね、簡単に
貸せるものではないんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Sorry, but those pact rings
are pretty valuable. I can't
just lend them out so easily.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310356</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_053&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>契約の指輪は、
現代の技術では作れないし、
修理するのも難しい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Pact rings can't be made with the
smithing techniques we have in this
age, and repairing them is difficult, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310356</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_054&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>残っている数も少ない。
それほど貴重なものなんだ。
悪いが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not many of them are left.
That's what makes them
valuable. Sorry, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310420</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_055&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Come on...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310528</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_056&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……しょうがないよ……
あきらめて他の方法を
探すしか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...If that's how it is, I guess...
We'll just have to give up on
this and search for another way...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310648</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_057&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ただ精霊の力が必要と
いうだけなら、他にも
方法はあるかもしれないな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If all you need is some of
the spirits' powers, there may
be another way, actually.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310720</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_058&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうなんですか！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is that true!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310836</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_059&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ&lt;White&gt;の
バジルという学者なら
何か知ってるかもしれない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, there's an academic in
&lt;Red&gt;Valhalla&lt;White&gt; called Basil. He'll
probably know something.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>310896</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_060&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>本当に？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311064</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_061&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、私が一緒に行って
話を通してやろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. I'll come with you
and help talk to him.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311064</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_062&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>イフリートを連れてきたら、
協力するという約束だったしな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I did promise I'd help you out
if you brought Efreet to me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311156</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_063&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やった！　サンキュー！
レスター博士！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nice! Thanks,
Prof. Lester!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_064&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルールル！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleururu!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311360</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_065&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>喜ぶのはバジルに
会ってからだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't get too happy until
we've actually met with Basil.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311360</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_066&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それから、
私のことは&lt;Klarth&gt;でいい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, and just call
me &lt;Klarth&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311456</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_067&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうね、その博士って
なんか気持ち悪いもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right. It's kind of
gross to think of him
as a professor, anyway.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>58</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311560</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_068&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>気持ち悪いってな……
まぁ、いいか。
それじゃあ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Gross," huh...?
Well, whatever.
Alright, then...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>59</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311632</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_069&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっと出かけてくる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll be going out
for a while.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>60</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>311692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_040_070&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ええ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sure.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>61</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
